# Dropping a dock widget on a corner whose stack is full (two mediums
# already take the half-body cap) used to park it off the paintable
# area: no rect, no hit, only dock.close_all knew it existed. The drop
# now snaps to the nearest corner with room and says so; the layout
# never drops a widget that some corner can hold.
command dock.add_preset
key enter
expect screen contains "Clock"
command dock.add_preset
key down
key down
key enter
expect screen contains "Log: run.log"
command dock.add_preset
key down
key down
key down
key enter
type remember
key enter
expect screen contains "Note"
expect screen contains "remember"
drag 100 1 40 30
expect screen contains "Clock"
expect screen contains "Bottom-left is full"
expect screen contains "remember"
expect screen contains "Log: run.log"
